# =============================================================================
#  The Question (Ren'Py -> VNDS .scr port)
#  Original: LSF Team (Ren'Py tutorial novel)
# =============================================================================
sound ~
music ~
setvar ~ ~

bgload menu.jpg
text ~
delay 1200

music music/illurock.mp3

bgload lecturehall.jpg
text Well, professor Eileen's lecture was interesting.
text But to be honest, I couldn't concentrate on it very much.
text I had a lot of other thoughts on my mind.
text And they all ended up with a question.
text A question, I've been meaning to ask someone.

bgload uni.jpg
setimg sylvie_normal.png center
text When we came out of the university, I saw her.
text She was a wonderful person.
text I've known her ever since we were children.
text And she's always been a good friend.
text But...
text Recently...
text I think...
text ... that I wanted more.
text More just talking... more than just walking home together when our classes ended.
text And I decided...

choice ... to ask her right away. | ... to ask her later.
if selected == 1
  goto rightaway
fi
if selected == 2
  goto later
fi

label rightaway

setimg sylvie_smile.png center
text Oh, hi, do we walk home together?
text Yes...
text I said and my voice was already shaking.

bgload meadow.jpg
text We reached the meadows just outside our hometown.
text Autumn was so beautiful here.
text When we were children, we often played here.
text Hey... ummm...
setimg sylvie_smile.png center
text She turned to me and smiled.
text I'll ask her...
text Ummm... will you...
text Will you be my artist for a visual novel?
setimg sylvie_surprised.png center
text Silence.
text She is shocked. And then...
setimg sylvie_smile.png center
text Sure, but what is a "visual novel?"

choice It's a story with pictures. | It's a hentai game.
if selected == 1
  goto vn
fi
if selected == 2
  goto hentai
fi

label vn

text It's a story with pictures and music.
text And you'll be able to make choices that influence the outcome of the story.
text So it's like those choose-your-adventure books?
text Exactly! I plan on making a small romantic story.
text And I figured you could help me... since I know how you like to draw.
setimg sylvie_normal.png center
text Well, I can try. I hope I don't disappoint you.
text You can't disappoint me, you know that.

goto marry

label hentai

setvar bl_game 1

text Why it's a game with lots of sex.
text You mean, like a boy's love game?
text I've always wanted to make one of those.
text I'll get right on it!
spriteclear
text ...
text That wasn't what I meant!

goto marry

label marry

bgload ~
text --- years later ---

bgload club.jpg
text And so, we became a visual novel creating team.
text We made games and had a lot of fun making them.

if bl_game >= 1
  text Well, apart from that Boy's Love game she insisted on making.
fi

text And one day...
setimg sylvie2_normal.png center
text Hey...
text Yes?
setimg sylvie2_giggle.png center
text Marry me!
text What???
setimg sylvie2_surprised.png center
text Well, don't you love me?
text I do, actually.
setimg sylvie2_smile.png center
text See? We've been making romantic visual novels, spending time together, helping each other....
text ... and when you give love to others, love will come to you.
text Hmmm, that's a nice thought.
setimg sylvie2_giggle.png center
text I just made that up.
text But it's good.
setimg sylvie2_normal.png center
text I know. So, will you marry me?
text Ummm, of course I will. I've actually been meaning to ask you, but since you brought it up...
text I know, but you are so indecisive, that I thought I'd take the initiative.
text I guess... It's all about asking the right question... at the right time.
setimg sylvie2_giggle.png center
text It is. But now, stop being theoretical, and give me a kiss!

bgload ~
text And we got married shortly after that.
text In fact, we made many more visual novels.
text And together, we lived happily ever after.
text .:. Good Ending.
goto finish

label later

bgload ~
text And so I decided to ask her later.
text But I was indecisive.
text I couldn't ask her that day, and I couldn't ask her later.
text I guess I will never know now.
text .:. Bad Ending.

label finish
